  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ZIMBABWE ELECTION SUPPORT NETWORK, 2012-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe Election Support Network, 2012-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka deltagandet av det civila        samh&#xe4;llet i alla valprocesser f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja demokratiska v&#xe4;rderingar och en gynnsam milj&#xf6; f&#xf6;r fria och r&#xe4;ttvisa val. ZESNs program &#xe4;r      inriktat p&#xe5; fem omr&#xe5;den: demokratiutbildning, valobservation,         forskning och opinionsbildning, media och information samt            n&#xe4;tverkande och kapacitetuppbyggnad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective is to facilitate the participation of civil society in all elections in order to promote democratic values and a  transparent, free and fair electoral environment.The project focuses  on five program areas: Democracy Education, Election Monitoring and   Observation, Research and Advocacy, Media and Information as well as  Networking and Capacity Building.</narrative>
  </description>
